"        <h3 id='consistency' class=\"pb-2 pt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">\n"
"          <a href=\"#consistency\">Konsistenz</a>\n"
"        </h3>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          Für die erfolgreiche Simulation benötigt WeBus konsistente Daten. "
"Ist dies nicht gegeben, kann das Hochladen der Datei fehlschlagen oder es "
"kann zum Absturz der Simulation führen.\n"
"          Folgende Punkte müssen im Umlaufplan beachtet werden.\n"
"          <ul class=\"list-inside list-disc text-slate-800\">\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Ein Umlauf kann nicht durch mehrere "
"Fahrzeugtypen bedient werden.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Ein Umlauf muss in einem Depot starten und "
"enden.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Das Depot, in dem ein Umlauf startet und "
"endet, muss identisch sein.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Fahrten eines Umlaufes müssen nacheinander "
"stattfinden. Fahrtzeiten dürfen sich <b>nicht</b> überschneiden.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Fahrten müssen von der Station abfahren, bei "
"der sie kürzlich angekommen sind.</li>\n"
"          </ul>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          To simulate your bus system, WeBus requires input data. This can "
"be uploaded in the following formats:\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-slate-800\">VDV 452</"
"li>\n"
"        <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-slate-800\">SimBA .csv</"
"li>\n"
"        <h3 id='vdv_452' class=\"pb-2 pt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">\n"
"          <a href=\"#vdv_452\">VDV 452</a>\n"
"        </h3>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www."
"vdv.de/downloads/4328/452V1%%206%%20SDS/forced\">VDV Schrift 452</a> "
"describes an interface for exchanging various information,\n"
"          such as scheduled timetables, line networks, connection "
"definitions, and electromobility.\n"
"          A large number of tools allow you to export your blocking schedule "
"directly to VDV 452. An incomplete list can be found <a class=\"text-"
"blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.vdv.de/kompatible-"
"produkte-8.2013.pdfx\">here</a>. The file type for this interface is <i>."
"X10</i>\n"
"          The export must contain the following files.\n"
"          <!-- no need for translation -->\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_BASIS_VERSIONEN</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>BASIS_VER_GUELTIGKEIT</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>FIRMENKALENDER</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_TAGESART</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_ONR_TYP</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_ORT_TYP</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-slate-800\"><i>REC_HP</"
"i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-slate-800\"><i>REC_OM</"
"i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_ORT</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>FAHRZEUG</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>ZUL_VERKEHRSBETRIEB</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_BEREICH</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_FZG_TYP</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_ANR</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_ZNR</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_SEL</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_SEL_ZP</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_FGR</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>ORT_HZTF</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>SEL_FZT_FELD</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_UEB</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>UEB_FZT</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>MENGE_FAHRTART</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>LID_VERLAUF</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_LID</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_FRT</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_FRT_HZT</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>REC_UMLAUF</i></li>\n"
"          <!-- no need for translation -->\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The files must be uploaded as a .zip file and are processed "
"automatically by WeBus. File sizes up to %(max_file_size_mb)s MB are "
"allowed.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h3 id='simba_schedule' class=\"pb-2 pt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">\n"
"          <a href=\"#simba_schedule\">SimBA Format</a>\n"
"        </h3>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          WeBus allows the .csv file format according to the SimBA "
"specification. This is a specific format for <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:"
"underline\" href=\"https://github.com/rl-institut/SimBA\">SimBA</a>. You can "
"find the format specification <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" "
"href='https://rli-simba.readthedocs.io/en/latest/simulation_parameters."
"html#schedule'>here</a>. For WeBus, a further reduced format can be used.\n"
"          WeBus expects a .csv file using a comma / ',' as the delimiter. "
"The following column names MUST be included.\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>departure_name</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>departure_time</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>arrival_name</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>arrival_time</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>distance</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>vehicle_type</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-"
"slate-800\"><i>rotation_id</i></li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside list-disc py-1 text-slate-800\"><i>line</"
"i></li>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >departure_name</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The name of the departure station. Each unique name is mapped to a "
"stop.\n"
"          Stops with the same name are treated as identical stops.\n"
"          Electrification settings for stops are identical for all stops "
"with the same name.\n"
"          When stops are created for the simulation model, no distinction is "
"made between departure and destination stations.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >departure_time</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The departure time in <a href='https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"ISO_8601'>ISO format</a>. Example for 30 June 2025 at 18:30 CEST - daylight "
"saving time: <i>2025-06-30T18:30:00+02:00</i>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >arrival_name</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The name of the destination station. Each unique name is mapped to "
"a stop.\n"
"          Stops with the same name are treated as identical stops.\n"
"          Electrification settings for stops are identical for all stops "
"with the same name.\n"
"          When stops are created for the simulation model, no distinction is "
"made between departure and destination stations.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\">arrival_time</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The arrival time in <a href='https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"ISO_8601'>ISO format</a>. Example for 30 June 2025 at 18:30 CEST - daylight "
"saving time: <i>2025-06-30T18:30:00+02:00</i>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >distance</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The distance in meters between the departure and destination "
"stations that the bus has to travel.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >vehicle_type</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The name of the vehicle type serving this trip. Any name can be "
"chosen. Vehicle types with the same name are treated as identical in the "
"model. Example: <a>double-decker</a>\n"
"          The trip is served by the vehicle type \"double-decker\".\n"
"          If there is another trip that requires a different vehicle type, e."
"g. \"articulated bus\", this necessarily requires an additional vehicle "
"within the simulation.\n"
"          Trips, or blocks, with the same vehicle type can be served by the "
"same vehicle if the operational and energy conditions allow it.\n"
"          This can be the case when the blocks do not take place at the same "
"time, and the time between the blocks is sufficient to charge the vehicle.\n"
"          <br><b>Trips within a block MUST be served by the same vehicle "
"type.</b>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >rotation_id</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-block\">\n"
"          The ID of the block. Trips with the same ID belong to one block "
"and are served by one vehicle.\n"
"          <br><b>A block must start and end at a depot. The starting and "
"ending depot must be identical.</b>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >line</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          The line to which the trip belongs. This is an optional field that "
"can help support filtering when displaying inputs and results.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >Example</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          A minimal blocking schedule with one bus type describing a single "
"block of one line. The block consists of a pull-out trip, a pull-in trip, "
"and a passenger trip from \"Hauptbahnhof\" to \"Rathaus\".\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg shadow\">\n"
"          <table class=\"min-w-full border border-slate-200 text-left text-"
"sm\">\n"
"            <thead class=\"bg-slate-100\">\n"
"              <tr>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">departure_name</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">departure_time</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">arrival_name</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">arrival_time</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">vehicle_type</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">rotation_id</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">line</th>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"            </thead>\n"
"            <tbody>\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Depot "
"Hauptstraße</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:30:00+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Hauptbahnhof</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:38:00+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">12m_Bus</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">UMLAUF_001</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">M250</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-100\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Hauptbahnhof</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:38:30+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Rathaus</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:42:00+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">12m_Bus</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">UMLAUF_001</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">M250</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-100\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Rathaus</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:42:30+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Depot "
"Hauptstraße</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">2025-06-30T18:49:00+02:00</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">12m_Bus</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">UMLAUF_001</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">M250</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"            </tbody>\n"
"          </table>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"        <h3 id='consistency' class=\"pb-2 pt-4 text-xl font-semibold\">\n"
"          <a href=\"#consistency\">Consistency</a>\n"
"        </h3>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          WeBus requires consistent data for a successful simulation. If "
"this is not the case, uploading the file may fail or it may cause the "
"simulation to crash.\n"
"          The following points must be observed in the blocking schedule.\n"
"          <ul class=\"list-inside list-disc text-slate-800\">\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">A block cannot be served by multiple vehicle "
"types.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">A block must start and end at a depot.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">The depot at which a block starts and ends "
"must be identical.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Trips within a block must take place one "
"after another. Trip times must <b>not</b> overlap.</li>\n"
"            <li class=\"py-1\">Trips must depart from the station at which "
"they most recently arrived.</li>\n"
"          </ul>\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        "

