"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Erforderlich</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">is_electrified</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[bool]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Ist die "
"Haltestelle elektrifiziert?</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Erforderlich</td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">voltage_level</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[HV, "
"HV_MV, MV, MV_LV, LV]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Erforderlich, wenn Haltestelle elektrifiziert ist. An welchem "
"Spannungsniveau ist der Netzanschlusspunkt. HV: Hochspannung, MV: "
"Mittelspannung und LV: Niederspannung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">charge_level</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[depb, "
"oppb]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Erforderlich, wenn Haltestelle elektrifiziert ist.\n"
"                Handelt es sich um ein Depot (depb) oder um eine normale "
"Haltestelle (oppb)?</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">amount_charging_places</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[int]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Wie viele "
"Ladepunkte besitzt die Haltestelle. Wenn die Station elektrifiziert ist und "
"dieser Wert \"null\" ist, so wird eine unbegrenzte Anzahl an Ladepunkten "
"angenommen.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">power_per_charger</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[float]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Wie viel "
"Ladeleistung steht pro Ladepunkt maximal zur Verfügung. Erforderlich, wenn "
"Haltestelle elektrifiziert ist.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">power_total</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[float]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Wie viel "
"Ladeleistung steht für die gesamte Haltestelle zur Verfügung? Übersteigt die "
"angefragte Leistung aller Ladesäulen diesen Wert, so werden die Ladesäulen "
"gedrosselt betrieben.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Keine "
"Empfehlung</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"            </tbody>\n"
"          </table>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          WeBus allows you to examine your bus system under various "
"electrification states.\n"
"          In the simulation, vehicles capable of opportunity charging are "
"charged at electrified stops whenever free charging points are available.\n"
"          The charging power depends on the defined charging power per "
"charging point and the vehicle's charging curve, with the lower of the two "
"values being decisive.\n"
"          To this end, each stop can be assigned a number of charging points "
"and a charging power per charging point.\n"
"          Charging points are occupied \"greedily\". This means an arriving "
"vehicle always takes the opportunity to charge.\n"
"          For these opportunity charges, no complex mechanism is used to "
"prevent vehicles from charging or to end charging early.\n"
"          This appears impractical for real-world operation. For now, the "
"user interface only shows stops with a dwell time of at least 2 minutes.\n"
"          Stations at which no single bus stands for at least 2 minutes even "
"once are hidden.\n"
"          This allows targeted electrification of stations that can supply a "
"relevant amount of energy to the vehicle.\n"
"          <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >Electrification</"
"h4>\n"
"          <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800\">\n"
"            Stops can be manually selected and specifically electrified in "
"the calculation model. They can be assigned a specific charging power per "
"charging point and a number of charging points. If no number of charging "
"points is entered, the number is assumed to be unlimited.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >Non-Electrification</"
"h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-80 text-block0\">\n"
"          The stop is assumed to be non-electrified. During the simulation, "
"vehicles will not charge at these stops. This is the default value for all "
"stops.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >Automatic</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-block\">\n"
"          This setting checks whether the bus system under examination is "
"operable without electrifying any stops. If a bus system becomes operable "
"when stops are electrified,\n"
"          the simulation uses an optimization algorithm to electrify a small "
"number of stops in order to achieve operability.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <h4 class=\"text-m pb-1 pt-4 font-semibold\" >Recommendation</h4>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-block\">\n"
"          Selecting the right stops that need to be electrified to create an "
"operable scenario can be very complex. We therefore recommend proceeding as "
"follows:\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <ul class=\"list-disc\">\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside py-1 text-slate-800\">Set stations that "
"must not or cannot be electrified, e.g. due to space constraints, to \"non-"
"electrified\".</li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside py-1 text-slate-800\">Set stations that "
"should definitely be electrified to \"electrified\" and set the parameters "
"accordingly.</li>\n"
"          <li class=\"list-inside py-1 text-slate-800\">Set all other "
"stations to \"automatic\".</li>\n"
"        </ul>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-m pb-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-block\">\n"
"          This gives you optimal starting conditions for creating an "
"operable scenario.\n"
"          In further iterations, you can create additional variants by "
"selectively setting electrification and non-electrification for stations.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"      </section>\n"
"      <section>\n"
"        <h2 id=\"advanced_options\" class=\"pb-2 pt-4 text-2xl font-"
"semibold\">\n"
"          <a href=\"#advanced_options\">Advanced Options</a>\n"
"        </h2>\n"
"        <p class=\"text-base pb-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-800 text-"
"block\">\n"
"          In <a href=\"#expert_mode\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:"
"underline\">expert mode</a>, the setting simba_options in the Scenario table "
"can be used to influence charging behavior during opportunity charging.\n"
"          <b>simba_options[\"min_charging_time\"]</b>: Minimum dwell time "
"required to carry out an opportunity charge.\n"
"          Value in minutes. For dwell times shorter than this, the vehicle "
"will not be charged.\n"
"          The default value is 0. <br>\n"
"          <b>simba_options[\"buffer_time_opps\"]</b>: The duration in "
"minutes after an arrival before an opportunity charge can begin.\n"
"          For dwell times greater than the \"min_charging_time\", the "
"available charging time is reduced by this value.\n"
"          This value can represent, for example, the process of connecting "
"and disconnecting the pantograph or plugging in and unplugging a connector. "
"<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"          In WeBus, stops are also referred to as Station and have the "
"following attributes, which can also be changed via expert mode.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg shadow\">\n"
"          <table class=\"min-w-full border border-slate-200 text-left text-"
"sm\">\n"
"            <thead class=\"bg-slate-100\">\n"
"              <tr>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Attribute</"
"th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Unit</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Description</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">Recommendation</th>\n"
"                <th class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required</"
"th>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"            </thead>\n"
"            <tbody>\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">name</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[-]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Name of "
"the station</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">name_short</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[-]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Short name "
"of the station</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">geom</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[-]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Geographic "
"position of the station in SRID 4326 format with longitude, latitude, and "
"elevation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">is_electrifiable</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[bool]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Is it "
"possible to electrify the stop? This value is required for the "
"electrification optimizer.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">is_electrified</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[bool]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Is the "
"stop electrified?</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">voltage_level</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[HV, "
"HV_MV, MV, MV_LV, LV]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required "
"if the stop is electrified. At which voltage level is the grid connection "
"point. HV: high voltage, MV: medium voltage, and LV: low voltage</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">charge_level</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[depb, "
"oppb]</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Required "
"if the stop is electrified.\n"
"                Is this a depot (depb) or a regular stop (oppb)?</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">amount_charging_places</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[int]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">How many "
"charging points does the stop have. If the station is electrified and this "
"value is \"null\", an unlimited number of charging points is assumed.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">power_per_charger</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[float]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">How much "
"charging power is available per charging point at maximum. Required if the "
"stop is electrified.</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"\n"
"              <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 "
"py-2\">power_total</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">[float]</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">How much "
"charging power is available for the entire stop? If the requested power of "
"all charging points exceeds this value, the charging points are throttled.</"
"td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">No "
"recommendation</td>\n"
"                <td class=\"border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-2\">Optional</"
"td>\n"
"              </tr>\n"
"            </tbody>\n"
"          </table>\n"
"        </div>\n"
"        "

